## Audit baseline — 2026-06-09 (32 core components, excl. 78 icons / 20 illustrations)

**Overall:** the library is in good shape — auto-layout is used on all the right
components, **visible-surface token binding is ~100%** (the apparent gaps were icon
bounding boxes, see P1-D), and **component descriptions exist on ~all sets**. Token
system: `1. Primitives` (77), `2. Tokens` (125), `3. Semantic` (88, single `Light` mode).
The optimization headroom is concentrated below. **Status @ 2026-06-09: P1-D, P2-E, P2-G
PUBLISHED + verified; P1-C & P2-F revised/deferred; P1-A deferred by owner; P1-B ready.**

### Token-tier (3-tier) audit — 2026-06-17 (PENDING RE-PUBLISH, manifest patches[0])
Swept all 31 core components, every variant/state, for the rule **"components bind colors to `3. Semantic`"** (+ unbound colors + text styles). **23/31 fully compliant** (incl. Button/Button-Pill/Icon Button @ 342 variants, 100% semantic). **Fixed (value-matched, no visual change):** Card (Amber primitives → `Surface/Warning/Outlined-Tint` + `Border/Warning/Bold`), Bottom Nav FAB, Avatar Initials fill + all rings, Toggle off-knob, Keyboard background + 2 unbound text. **Created `Border/Warning/Bold`** (3.Semantic, alias `Color/Warning/500` #f9aa16, scope STROKE_COLOR) — the recurring gold ring/accent had no semantic home (name pending review). **Still open (judgment calls):** Avatar Initials text + Logo brand + Status Bar On-Action bind to **remote** tokens (Logo/Status Bar likely intentional); Passcode pressed bg has no exact semantic surface. **Text-style gaps** (separate dimension): Keyboard 44/44 numpad labels, Avatar 2/3 Initials — flagged for a follow-up. Lesson: tier ≠ "is it bound" — check the *collection* a color resolves through; `Color/*` names (Warning/Amber/Neutral/Primary) are `1/2`-tier, role names (`Surface/Border/Text/Icon`) are `3. Semantic`.

### Prioritized optimization backlog (status @ 2026-06-09)
**P1 — high impact**
- **A. Variable modes for theming.** ⏸️ **DEFERRED by owner** (no dark mode in product yet).
  `3. Semantic` has a single `Light` mode; dark is bolted on via duplicate `Text/Inverse`
  / `Surface/Brand-Elevated` / `Icon/Inverse` tokens (manifest patches `2026-06-01`). When
  dark ships: add a **Dark mode** to `3. Semantic`, move dark values there, retire the
  parallel inverse tokens. Biggest "current-Figma-feature" win.
- **B. Button variant explosion.** 🔜 **READY — not yet executed (high blast radius).**
  `Button` (144) & `Button - Pill` (144) = `Appearance(3)×Type(2)×Size(2)×State(3)×Icon
  Size(4)`. **`Icon Size` should not be a variant axis** — drive icon size from the button
  `Size` instead. Collapsing → **144 → 36** each. Deletes 108 published variants used by 3
  consumer files → stage it with before/after + republish + re-test (not an unattended sweep).
- **C. Boolean-able variant axes.** ❌ **REVISED — keep as variants.** On inspection these
  axes drive *appearance/color* (`Toggle State` = knob position/structural; `Disabled` /
  `Selected` = color), which Figma booleans can't apply (booleans only toggle
  visibility/instance-swap). Converting = hacky overlay rebuild, not a clean win. Reco retracted.
- **D. Icon bounding boxes filled `#d9d9d9`.** ✅ **DONE + PUBLISHED + VERIFIED 2026-06-09.**
  Cleared the default-gray fill on 85 icon bounding boxes → transparent; verified live via
  fresh import (mobile icon `fills=[]`). Standard: icon bounding boxes carry **no fill**;
  recolor only glyph `VECTOR`s.

**P2 — medium impact**
- **E. Expose nested instances.** ✅ **DONE + PUBLISHED + VERIFIED 2026-06-09** (Bottom Nav
  imports with 4 exposed Tab Bar Items; Card Icon Glyph exposed). Exposed Bottom Nav 16 Tab
  Bar Items, Tab Bar Item icon, Card Icon Glyph, Dialog Illustration + Action (Bot Nav Action
  was already exposed; Dialog action buttons can't be exposed — nested in the exposed Action).
- **F. Instance-swap gaps.** ⏸️ **DEFERRED.** `Avatar` Type=Icon content is a baked-in
  2-ellipse silhouette (not an instance); adding an Icon/Image swap means restructuring it
  and changing the default look → do as a deliberate design pass. Type=Image already carries
  content via image fill; Type=Initials via the Initials text prop.
- **G. Component descriptions / Code Connect.** ✅ **MOSTLY DONE 2026-06-09.** Descriptions
  already existed on ~all sets (good); filled the 2 missing (List Item, Chip). **Code Connect
  still TODO** — needs the consuming codebase (not in this repo).

**P3 — low / hygiene**
- `Bot Nav Action` rep variant reads `layoutMode=NONE` — verify all `Type`s use auto
  layout (containers must).
- Leaf graphics with no AL/props (`Spinner`, `Keyboard`, `Status Bar` internals,
  `Progress Tracker`, `Home Indicator`, `Face ID`, `Scroll Edge Effect`) — acceptable;
  no action.
- `Dialog` illustration container fill `#ffffff` and `Bottom Nav` `Gift Animated`
  `#000000` — confirm intentional vs. leftover.

